{
  "kingdom": "lordaeron",
  "rev": 1,
  "about": "Composition rules for Lordaeron towns: which kits fill which slots at each tier, how a plot's yards are chosen, how the forum, avenues and wall dress up as the town grows. Every asset id is one we have delivered (batches 002-009). Choice is deterministic: hash(town id, slot) picks among weighted options. The client's solver composes houses from lordaeron/timber_relief; these rules say which house to ask it for.",
